================================================================================
Overpass API (engine)
================================================================================

This tooling deploys the Overpass API database engine. It is not included in
this repository; it is pulled at runtime as a container image.

  Overpass API
  Copyright (c) Roland Olbricht and the Overpass API contributors
  Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)
  https://github.com/drolbr/Overpass-API

  Docker image: wiktorn/Overpass-API
  https://github.com/wiktorn/Overpass-API

As an AGPL-3.0 network service, an Overpass endpoint deployed with this tooling
must offer its users access to the corresponding source of the engine. When the
upstream image is run unmodified, that source is the public repository above.

